# Alembic migration environment for the eFootball marketplace.

Create a new revision after changing models:

```bash
uv run alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe schema change"
uv run alembic upgrade head
```

The PostgreSQL service must be available to apply migrations. The initial
revision is checked in at `alembic/versions/20260924_0001_create_marketplace_schema.py`;
on a clean database, `upgrade head` creates the current schema.
